<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:46:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>阿尔茨海默病可能在脑部扫描检测到之前 7 年就开始出现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/alzheimers-may-begin-7-years-before-brain-scans-detect-it</link><description>一项令人惊讶的发现表明，关键的警告信号可能早在医生发现之前就已经出现。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/alzheimers-may-begin-7-years-before-brain-scans-detect-it.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:46:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/alzheimers-may-begin-7-years-before-brain-scans-detect-it</guid></item><item><title>科学家研制出可杀死癌细胞而不伤害健康细胞的 LED 灯</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-led-light-that-kills-cancer-cells-without-harming-healthy-ones</link><description>一种新的光驱动癌症疗法使用 LED 和锡纳米片安全且经济地杀死肿瘤。它由德克萨斯州和葡萄牙的团队开发，可消除高达 92% 的皮肤癌细胞，且不会伤害健康细胞。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-create-led-light-that-kills-cancer-cells-without-harming-healthy-ones.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:31:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-led-light-that-kills-cancer-cells-without-harming-healthy-ones</guid></item><item><title>T 细胞疗法在治疗侵袭性脑癌方面显示出前景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/t-cell-therapy-shows-promise-in-treating-aggressive-brain-cancer</link><description>此外，研究人员观察到，超过一半的参与者在治疗后长达三年的时间里肿瘤停止生长或缩小，其中一名参与者的癌症至今仍处于完全缓解状态。研究小组表示，靶向 B7-H3 的 CAR-T 细胞疗法可以为患有难治性复发性胶质母细胞瘤的患者带来新的希望，这些患者目前几乎没有选择。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/t-cell-therapy-shows-promise-in-treating-aggressive-brain-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:16:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/t-cell-therapy-shows-promise-in-treating-aggressive-brain-cancer</guid></item><item><title>血压治疗可降低痴呆风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/blood-pressure-treatment-linked-to-lower-dementia-risk</link><description>一项重大试验表明，更好的血压控制可能会给大脑健康带来意想不到的好处。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/blood-pressure-treatment-linked-to-lower-dementia-risk.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:01:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/blood-pressure-treatment-linked-to-lower-dementia-risk</guid></item><item><title>无限平面电荷层产生的电场</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/electric-field-due-to-infinite-plane-sheet-of-charge</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:46:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/electric-field-due-to-infinite-plane-sheet-of-charge</guid></item><item><title>该声明意味着129.3亿美元的收购价格是一个技术性的内部幽默</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-statement-means-that-the-12-93-billion-acquisition-price-is-a-piece-of-technical-inside-humor</link><description>它将“Hugging Face”表情符号 (🤗) 和对 NVIDIA 品牌颜色的认可直接编码到财务数据中，作为对使 Hugging Face 具有战略价值的社区的极客致敬。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-statement-means-that-the-12-93-billion-acquisition-price-is-a-piece-of-technical-inside-humor.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:31:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-statement-means-that-the-12-93-billion-acquisition-price-is-a-piece-of-technical-inside-humor</guid></item><item><title>日本正在发射探测器从火星卫星收集第一批样本</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/japan-is-launching-a-probe-to-collect-the-firstever-samples-from-a-martian-moon</link><description>一旦到达表面，机械臂就会将圆柱形管钻入表面以收集样本。该探测器还配备了美国宇航局首次开发的装置，该装置使用氮气流从最顶层的灰尘中收集细颗粒。专家认为，火卫一是否起源于对地球的撞